      },
      {
        "text": "the sea heard and not seen: a distant low surf under a thin drone",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "shakuhachi, breathy long notes with silences, wind over the dunes",
        "weight": 0.8
      },
      {
        "text": "dry rattling percussion like sand pouring, minimal and hypnotic, a slow repeating pattern",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a ticking clock and a dripping water jar in a hot room, sparse, no melody",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a koto plucked sparsely, a few cold notes, an insect pinned in a box",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a low hum of wind in a rope and a winch, metallic and creaking, night above the pits",
        "weight": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "a slow bowed bass and cello cluster, the walls of a pit closing in, claustrophobic",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a radio far off playing a cheerful pop tune, muffled, absurd in the sand",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a warm low drone and a hearth's crackle, a lamp in a sand-filled room, tired tenderness",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "shimmering heat haze textures, high glassy tones, white noon over the dunes",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a lone flute melody far away, a bus that has already gone",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a slow soft taiko heartbeat, night digging, endless labour",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "brushed metal and scraped sand textures, a shovel's rhythm, rough and patient",
        "weight": 0
      },
      {
        "text": "a lantern-lit night, wind across sand, distant dogs, sparse",
